## Secrets and credentials ##################################################
# Secrets come from user secrets (outside the repo) locally and environment variables when deployed;
# see docs/configuration.md. These patterns catch the usual ways one slips into the working tree anyway.
appsettings.*.local.json
appsettings.local.json
secrets.json
*.secrets.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
*.snk
*.cer
*.crt
*.jks
*.keystore
*.publishsettings
*.pubxml.user
*.azurePubxml
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

## Diagnostics output (can hold secrets, tokens and request content) #########
# MSBuild binary logs record environment variables; dumps and traces record process memory.
*.binlog
*.dmp
*.mdmp
*.gcdump
*.nettrace
*.speedscope.json
logs/
*.log

